the title versus a specific like the energize.&nbsp;
This is going to energize me, give me what I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:18.320 --> 00:40:23.320
want. There's also the trade-off of this will help&nbsp;
me in my future career. There's always this idea,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:23.320 --> 00:40:26.560
if I do this, this will help me with the&nbsp;
next step. In the next step. Is there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:26.560 --> 00:40:29.520
anything more there along trade-offs that&nbsp;
might be helpful for people to understand?

00:40:29.520 --> 00:40:35.640
The only thing that I say has really been powerful&nbsp;
is just helping people see the trade-off. They&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:35.640 --> 00:40:40.880
don't actually take the time to look at this job&nbsp;
is going to be more money, but I'm going to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:40.880 --> 00:40:46.120
doing more mundane things. Do I want more&nbsp;
money? Again, that entrepreneur was like,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:46.120 --> 00:40:51.800
I can make more money so I can save money for my&nbsp;
startup that I want to do, or I can go here and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:51.800 --> 00:40:56.240
learn what I need to do. And it was agonizing.&nbsp;
