00:40:56.240 --> 00:41:04.520
out? And ultimately, this is the hard answer&nbsp;
I would say is we're all adults and as adults,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:04.520 --> 00:41:08.920
we don't ever get all we want and we have to learn&nbsp;
how to make trade-offs. And what I've learned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:08.920 --> 00:41:14.240
is that I turned 60 this year, and the more I&nbsp;
actually get comfortable with making trade-offs,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:14.240 --> 00:41:18.960
the fact is the more satisfied I become.
